    m_Bank: 0
    m_Width: 9
    m_Count: 1
    m_Fields: []
    m_LastFieldId: 0
    m_Offset: 64
    m_Description: The volume the songs play at, 0 to 1, as the scripts last set it, under the player's music volume. Its default is a new game's
